1
00:00:00,381 --> 00:00:02,841
That's the Bottle City of Kandor.

2
00:00:03,843 --> 00:00:04,843
(Penny:)Uh-huh.

3
00:00:05,678 --> 00:00:09,638
(Leonard:)You see, Kandor was the capital city
of the planet Krypton.

4
00:00:09,807 --> 00:00:12,477
It was miniaturized by Brainiac
before Krypton exploded...

5
00:00:12,643 --> 00:00:14,433
(Leonard:)...and then rescued by Superman.

6
00:00:15,604 --> 00:00:18,064
(Penny:)Oh, nice.

7
00:00:18,732 --> 00:00:21,362
(Leonard:)It's a lot cooler
when girls aren't looking at it.

8
00:00:22,528 --> 00:00:25,778
(Penny:)Here, why don't you put these on
while I find a shirt and sport coat?

9
00:00:25,948 --> 00:00:28,618
- Great, be right back.
- Where are you going? Put them on.

10
00:00:28,784 --> 00:00:31,624
- Here?
- Oh, are you shy?

11
00:00:31,787 --> 00:00:34,037
- No, I'm not shy.
- Don't worry, I won't look.

12
00:00:34,206 --> 00:00:37,546
I know you won't. Why would you look?
There's nothing to see. Not noth...

13
00:00:37,710 --> 00:00:40,500
- Sweetie, put the pants on.
- I'm gonna put them on.

14
00:00:41,630 --> 00:00:44,920
So, you know, isn't there some way
you and Sheldon could compromise...

15
00:00:45,092 --> 00:00:46,512
...on this presentation thing?

16
00:00:46,677 --> 00:00:49,387
(Leonard:)No, no. Scientists do not compromise.

17
00:00:49,555 --> 00:00:53,395
Our minds are trained to synthesize facts
and come to inarguable conclusions.

18
00:00:53,893 --> 00:00:57,773
(Sheldon:)Not to mention,
Sheldon is bat-crap crazy.

19
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:01,400
(Penny:)What is this?

